  "_about": "AAR's own blade theme, generated by tools/gen_blades.py (edit that and regenerate): speed on a blue blade at the left (SPEED_SCALE) and revs on a red one at the right (0..8, red from 7), leaning straight in towards the top, each a solid fill from the bottom up to a white marker, glowing more in Sport. Speed and gear beside them with two-tone stripes, boost / oil / coolant / fuel readouts with bars, a see-through dark blue panel in the middle framing the Waze map (cut see-through while it shows inside the theme, 'mapUp', mapLive: no rebuild; a road runs there otherwise). Everything that isn't text is one shader (bdash). The bottom row has the clock, the range with a fuel bar under it (red in the reserve) and the outside temperature, BMW's gear letter left uncovered. Widget reference: shared/hud.js header.",
